    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suit Up </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/d6d63884f9559a13b6df905c4cae5810.poster.avif?t=1729343526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/d6d63884f9559a13b6df905c4cae5810.webm?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/d6d63884f9559a13b6df905c4cae5810.mp4?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combo Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/518c5de50d6bec74ce7d07706016f35a.poster.avif?t=1729343526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/518c5de50d6bec74ce7d07706016f35a.webm?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/518c5de50d6bec74ce7d07706016f35a.mp4?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Cube Types -- Normal, Void, Special, Water, Fire, and Inversion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/all_cubes.PNG?t=1729343526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crisp Cube is an action puzzle survival game where you clear cubes and control time. You play as the mysterious Mr. Crisp. In each level, he starts on one end of a grid-like play area while a diverse set of cubes appears at the other end. As these cubes roll towards Mr. Crisp, you must help him clear all but the black Void cubes to survive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suit Up </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/d6d63884f9559a13b6df905c4cae5810.poster.avif?t=1729343526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/d6d63884f9559a13b6df905c4cae5810.webm?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/d6d63884f9559a13b6df905c4cae5810.mp4?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combo Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/518c5de50d6bec74ce7d07706016f35a.poster.avif?t=1729343526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/518c5de50d6bec74ce7d07706016f35a.webm?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/518c5de50d6bec74ce7d07706016f35a.mp4?t=1729343526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Cube Types -- Normal, Void, Special, Water, Fire, and Inversion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1228880/extras/all_cubes.PNG?t=1729343526\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crisp Cube is an action puzzle survival game where you clear cubes and control time. You play as the mysterious Mr. Crisp. In each level, he starts on one end of a grid-like play area while a diverse set of cubes appears at the other end. As these cubes roll towards Mr. Crisp, you must help him clear all but the black Void cubes to survive.</p>",
    "short_description": "Crisp Cube is an action puzzle survival game where you clear cubes and control time. Crisp Cube is a bold reimagining of a classic Playstation game.",
